<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba, Roche in polymer cooperation.</title>
<headline>Ciba, Roche in polymer cooperation.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba Geigy AG said it and Roche Holding AG plan to cooperate in the development of vitamin E as a stabiliser for polymers.</p>
<p>As part of the agreement, Ciba said it will acquire the development and marketing rights for the vitamin E antioxidant line for polymers from Roche, who will supply vitamin E to Ciba.</p>
</text>
